If an elven wizard (atheist or otherwise) found Magicbane in a bones 
file, I would expect it to be chaotic - the starting alignment of all 
elves is chaotic and wizards' guaranteed first gift is Magicbane so 
hack_artifacts() will change its alignment. Artifacts' alignments are 
held in artilist, which doesn't appear to be changed when a bones level 
is loaded.

Generally I would expect the alignment of any artifacts found in bones 
files to be the same as if they were generated in any other way; a gift, 
found in the dungeon or wished for. Of course, you will never find your 
own quest artifact in a bones file, but you may find your guaranteed 
first gift artifact if it hasn't already been generated.


